# Markdown

Do not create or expand `.md` files unless the user asks. That includes README extras, ARCHITECTURE.md, LESSONS.md, and one-off notes.

Durable guidance belongs in:

- `AGENTS.md` (commit checks, pointers)
- `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` (behavior the agent must follow)
- Short comments next to the code they describe

If you change login, sessions, or other behavior covered by a rule, update that `.mdc` in the same change. Do not add a second document that will go stale.
